L003_invalid_escape.cmm:3:14: lexical error: invalid escape sequence '\k'
  |
3 |     let s = "\k";
  |              ^^
what went wrong:
  A backslash must be followed by one of the allowed letters, and '\k' is
  not one.
how to fix:
  Use one of \n, \t, \r, \", \', \\. To write a real backslash type '\\'.
      "first line\nsecond line"
